; Generated by scripts/generate-flt-modular-inverses.py; checked native proof terms.
; Compute the inverse from actual extended-gcd coefficients. Zero
; maps explicitly to zero; nonzero inputs use the signed first
; coefficient. The universal product is the computed gcd residue,
; so composite nonunits are not silently treated as field elements.
